flowchart TD
    A[Abnormal disaster card becomes active] --> B{Player country affected or observing}
    B -->|affected| C[Aftermath notification opens]
    B -->|observing only| D[Event Details abnormal tab updates]
    C --> E[Open aftermath category]
    E --> F{Abnormal map available}
    F -->|yes| G[Open abnormal disaster map]
    F -->|no| H[Use normal disaster cards]
    G --> I[Select active card]
    I --> J[Review path, next hit, risk badges]
    J --> K[Choose warning, rescue, or stabilization action]
    K --> L[Normal decision or mission effect resolves]
    L --> M[Card state and timeline update]
    M --> N{Card closed}
    N -->|no| I
    N -->|yes| O[Archive card and remove active pulse]
